fScore":{"score":5,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"distress","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-07T05:40:48.938Z","evidenceHash":"8f65b2610731f4810bd30d1328fef97e34c738cffd3b93b2aa6d0d91c3657b3f"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-07T05:40:48.938Z","evidenceHash":"8f65b2610731f4810bd30d1328fef97e34c738cffd3b93b2aa6d0d91c3657b3f"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/BLCO.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/BLCO.png","website":"https://www.bausch.com","ceo":"Thomas J. Appio","full_time_employees":"13000","description":"Bausch + Lomb Corporation is a leading global eye health company. Its operations are structured across three primary segments: Vision Care/Consumer Health, Ophthalmic Pharmaceuticals, and Surgical. The Vision Care/Consumer Health division offers a comprehensive portfolio of contact lenses, encompassing all wearing modalities from daily disposables to frequently replaced options. This segment also provides essential contact lens care products, over-the-counter eye drops, and nutritional supplements aimed at alleviating common eye conditions like allergies, conjunctivitis, and dry eye. Through its Ophthalmic Pharmaceuticals segment, the company develops and markets both proprietary and generic prescription medications. These pharmaceuticals are utilized for post-operative recovery and the treatment of various ocular diseases, such as glaucoma, ocular hypertension, and retinal disorders. Additionally, it supplies therapeutic contact lenses. The Surgical segment is dedicated to providing advanced tools and technologies for surgical interventions related to cataracts, as well as vitreous and retinal conditions. Its offerings include intraocular lenses (IOLs) with their delivery systems, phacoemulsification equipment, and a range of other specialized surgical instruments and devices. Founded in 1853, Bausch + Lomb is headquartered in Vaughan, Canada.","description_en":"Bausch + Lomb Corporation is a leading global eye health company. Its operations are structured across three primary segments: Vision Care/Consumer Health, Ophthalmic Pharmaceuticals, and Surgical. The Vision Care/Consumer Health division offers a comprehensive portfolio of contact lenses, encompassing all wearing modalities from daily disposables to frequently replaced options. This segment also provides essential contact lens care products, over-the-counter eye drops, and nutritional supplements aimed at alleviating common eye conditions like allergies, conjunctivitis, and dry eye. Through its Ophthalmic Pharmaceuticals segment, the company develops and markets both proprietary and generic prescription medications. These pharmaceuticals are utilized for post-operative recovery and the treatment of various ocular diseases, such as glaucoma, ocular hypertension, and retinal disorders. Additionally, it supplies therapeutic contact lenses. The Surgical segment is dedicated to providing advanced tools and technologies for surgical interventions related to cataracts, as well as vitreous and retinal conditions. Its offerings include intraocular lenses (IOLs) with their delivery systems, phacoemulsification equipment, and a range of other specialized surgical instruments and devices. Founded in 1853, Bausch + Lomb is headquartered in Vaughan, Canada.","description_zh":"Bausch + Lomb Corporation（美股代碼：BLCO）為 Healthcare 領域之重要企業，專注於 Medical - Instruments & Supplies 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"520 Applewood Crescent","city":"Vaughan","state":"ON","zip":"L4K 4B4","country":"CA","phone":"905 695 7700","full_address":"520 Applewood Crescent, Vaughan, ON L4K 4B4, CA","range_52w":"14.44-21.36","year_h